# Networking Task

Task: Configure time synchronization on this server using the system's time synchronization service.

- Use `{{ntp_server_1}}` and `{{ntp_server_2}}` as the primary NTP servers.
- Also configure `{{fallback_server}}` as a fallback NTP server (if your time synchronization service has no dedicated fallback setting, configure it as an additional server).
- The time synchronization service must be enabled and active.
- The configuration must persist across reboots.
